Williams and Wilkins</publisher-name><fpage>880</fpage><lpage>902</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Nichols DG, Ungerleider RM, Spevall PJ</surname></name></person-group><source>Critical Heart Disease in Infants and Children</source><year>2006</year><edition>2</edition><publisher-name>Philadelphia: Mosby</publisher-name><fpage>755</fpage><lpage>766</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Alsoufi</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>WG</given-names></name><name><surname>Hua</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Cai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Karamlou</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Chan</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Coles</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Van Arsdell</surname><given-names>GS</given-names></name><name><surname>Caldarone</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Surgical outcomes in the treatment of patients with tetralogy of Fallot and absent pulmonary valve</article-title><source>European Journal of Cardiothoracic Surgery</source><year>2007</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>354</fpage><lpage>359</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17215132</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ejcts.2006.12.001</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Jonas RA</surname></name></person-group><source>Comprehensive Surgical Management of Congenital Heart Disease</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>New York: Oxford University Press</publisher-name><fpage>279</fpage><lpage>300</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Karl</surname><given-names>TR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Atrioventricular septal defect with tetralogy of Fallot or double-outlet right ventricle: surgical considerations</article-title><source>Seminars in Thoracic Cardiovascular Surgery</source><year>1997</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>26</fpage><lpage>34</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9109222</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chiu</surname><given-names>IS</given-names></name><name><surname>Hung</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Chu</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Surgical treatment of complete atrioventricular septal defect associated with tetralogy of Fallot</article-title><source>International Journal of Cardiology</source><year>1995</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>225</fpage><lpage>230</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7782135</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0167-5273(94)02243-C</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hoohenkerk</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Schoof</surname><given-names>PH</given-names></name><name><surname>Bruggemans</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Rijlaarsdam</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hazekamp</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>28 years' experience with transatrial-transpulmonary repair of atrioventricular septal defect with tetralogy of Fallot</article-title><source>The Annals of Thoracic Surgery</source><year>2008</year><volume>85</volume><fpage>1686</fpage><lpage>1689</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18442566</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type